# Suraksha Setu - Production Frontend Configuration
# Leaving VITE_API_URL empty causes the frontend to use same-origin /api requests,
# which Vercel's rewrite rules transparently proxy to the Render backend (https://suraksha-setu-server.onrender.com).
# This prevents cross-origin cookie blocking in mobile/WhatsApp in-app browsers.
VITE_API_URL=
